<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has</p>
<p>completed all three credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>    CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>1.125  bln pesos 13 days  28.47</p>
<p>1.126  bln pesos 10 days  28.53</p>
<p>    1.000  bln pesos  1 day   28.02</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
